# Mentioned Project Rules

Use `AGENTS.md` for the authoritative repo guidance.

Key project shape:

- Backend code lives under `src/`.
- FastAPI app registration lives in `src/main.py`.
- Extraction pipeline lives in `src/extraction/`.
- Queued worker entrypoint lives in `src/worker.py`.
- Expo mobile app lives under `mobile/`.
- Generated runtime outputs such as `app.db` and `data/artifacts/` must not be committed.

AI layer source of truth:

- Edit commands in `.agents/commands/`.
- Edit skills in `.agents/skills/`.
- Edit Cursor rules in `.agents/rules/`.
- Do not edit symlinks under `.claude/commands/`, `.claude/skills/`, `.cursor/commands/`, or `.cursor/rules/` directly.
